'''Diablo's Ocean''' (Japanese: '''魔の海域''' ''Demon's Ocean'') is an {{pkmn|animated series}}-exclusive location in the [[Sinnoh]] region. It was featured in ''[[DP112|Cheers on Castaways Isle!]]''. It is located somewhere between [[Iron Island]] and [[Chocovine Town]].

The area is known for meteor showers, and the fallen rocks lay off the coast of a deserted island and give off a [[special magnetic field]] which causes navigation tools and instrumentation to go haywire or even break.

On the deserted island, the local {{type|Water}} {{OBP|Pokémon|species}} were gathering meteor fragments to help restore a {{p|Deoxys}} whose crystal landed on the island during a storm. The [[Mythical Pokémon]] was later revived after receiving help from [[Ash's Pikachu]] and [[Dawn's Piplup]].

