==Trivia==
* Diablo's Ocean is based on the {{wp|Bermuda Triangle}}, an area where many naval and aerial vehicles have sunk into the ocean because of powerful magnetic forces. This is further enforced by the Japanese name of "Demon's Ocean", similar to the alias of the Bermuda, "Devil's Triangle".

